<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>GA-HRMS System Architecture & Complete Learning Guide</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Fira+Code:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');

        :root {
            --primary: #4f46e5;
            --primary-dark: #3730a3;
            --secondary: #06b6d4;
            --accent: #8b5cf6;
            --bg: #f8fafc;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-main: #0f172a;
            --text-muted: #475569;
            --border: #e2e8f0;
            --code-bg: #0f172a;
            --success: #10b981;
            --warning: #f59e0b;
        }

        @media print {
            body {
                background: white !important;
                font-size: 11pt;
            }
            .page-break {
                page-break-before: always;
            }
            .no-print {
                display: none !important;
            }
            .card {
                box-shadow: none !important;
                border: 1px solid #cbd5e1 !important;
            }
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Header Cover */
        .cover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1b4b 0%, #312e81 50%, #4338ca 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 48px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .cover-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        }

        .cover h1 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .cover p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #c7d2fe;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .cover-meta {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #e0e7ff;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            padding-top: 16px;
        }

        /* Cards */
        .card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--primary-dark);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #e0e7ff;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
        }

        h3 {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #1e293b;
            margin: 20px 0 10px 0;
        }

        p, li {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.98rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        ul, ol {
            padding-left: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        /* Badges & Callouts */
        .alert {
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 16px 0;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .alert-info {
            background: #eff6ff;
            border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
            color: #1e40af;
        }

        .alert-success {
            background: #ecfdf5;
            border-left: 4px solid #10b981;
            color: #065f46;
        }

        .alert-warning {
            background: #fffbeb;
            border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
            color: #92400e;
        }

        /* Code Blocks */
        pre {
            background: var(--code-bg);
            color: #f8fafc;
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow-x: auto;
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin: 14px 0;
        }

        code {
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
            background: #f1f5f9;
            color: #db2777;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.88em;
        }

        pre code {
            background: none;
            color: inherit;
            padding: 0;
        }

        /* Tables */
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 16px 0;
            font-size: 0.92rem;
        }

        th, td {
            padding: 10px 14px;
            text-align: left;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        th {
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #334155;
        }

        tr:nth-child(even) {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
        }

        /* Diagram Box */
        .diagram {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px dashed #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #334155;
            white-space: pre;
            overflow-x: auto;
            margin: 16px 0;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 3px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .tag-get { background: #dbeafe; color: #1e40af; }
        .tag-post { background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; }
        .tag-put { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; }
        .tag-patch { background: #ede9fe; color: #5b21b6; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">

    <!-- Header Section -->
    <div class="cover">
        <span class="cover-badge">Complete Architecture & Code Manual</span>
        <h1>GA-HRMS Backend Platform</h1>
        <p>Production-Grade Enterprise Multi-Tenant HRMS | Architecture, Flow, & Code Reference</p>
        <div class="cover-meta">
            <div><strong>Stack:</strong> Java 21 LTS | Spring Boot 3.4.1 | PostgreSQL 16</div>
            <div><strong>Author:</strong> Dipratna Mahire</div>
            <div><strong>Version:</strong> Phase 0, 1 & 2 Complete</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 1: The Core Concept -->
    <div class="card">
        <h2>1. Architecture & Design Decisions</h2>
        <p><strong>GA-HRMS</strong> ek production-grade Human Resource Management System hai jo <strong>Modular Monolith</strong> pattern par bana hai:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Modular Monolith Kyu?</strong> Microservices me deployment, network latency, aur distributed transactions ki bohot zyada complexity hoti hai. Isliye monolithic repository me har module (Identity, Organization, Employee, Attendance, Payroll) ko alag package me strictly isolate kiya gaya hai.</li>
            <li><strong>Multi-Tenant Baseline:</strong> Database me ek hi table multiple companies ko serve karti hai. Har table me <code>company_id</code> se data alag rehta hai.</li>
            <li><strong>Effective Dating & Immutability:</strong> Company ya policy ke badalne se purana historical attendance aur salary data kabhi corrupt nahi hota.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="alert alert-info">
            <strong>Key Golden Rule:</strong> Controller me sirf HTTP request receive hoti hai aur validation hota hai. Sara business logic <code>Service</code> class me hota hai, aur database queries <code>Repository</code> handle karta hai.
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 2: Complete Folder Structure -->
    <div class="card page-break">
        <h2>2. Folder Structure & Responsibilities</h2>
        <p>Har folder ka ek specific kaam hai:</p>

        <div class="diagram">ga-hrms-backend/
├── 📁 config/
│   ├── ApplicationSecurityConfig.java  --> PasswordEncoder, UserDetailsService, AuthenticationManager
│   ├── SecurityConfig.java             --> SecurityFilterChain (CORS, CSRF, URL Protection)
│   ├── JwtAuthenticationFilter.java    --> Har incoming request se Bearer token verify karta hai
│   └── OpenApiConfig.java              --> Swagger UI / OpenAPI 3 settings
│
├── 📁 common/                          --> Shared DTOs & Error Handling
│   ├── dto/ApiResponse.java            --> Standard Response: {success, message, data, timestamp}
│   ├── dto/ErrorResponse.java          --> Standard Error: {status, errorCode, message, correlationId}
│   ├── dto/PageResponse.java           --> Pagination Helper (totalElements, totalPages, isLast)
│   ├── entity/BaseEntity.java          --> id, createdAt, updatedAt, version (Saari tables inherit karti hain)
│   └── exception/                      --> GlobalExceptionHandler, ConflictException, ResourceNotFoundException
│
├── 📁 modules/
│   ├── 📁 identity/                    --> Authentication & Roles
│   │   ├── AuthController.java         --> /api/v1/auth/login, /refresh, /logout, /me
│   │   ├── AuthService.java            --> Login verification, JWT issue karna
│   │   └── entity/                     --> User, Role, Permission, RefreshToken
│   │
│   ├── 📁 organization/                --> Company Hierarchy
│   │   ├── OrganizationController.java --> /companies, /branches, /departments, /designations
│   │   ├── OrganizationService.java    --> Hierarchy tree aur unique checks
│   │   └── entity/                     --> Company, Branch, Department, Designation
│   │
│   └── 📁 employee/                    --> Employee Lifecycle (Phase 2)
│       ├── EmployeeController.java     --> /api/v1/employees (Onboard, Directory, Profile, Status)
│       ├── EmployeeService.java        --> Auto Employee Code, Auto User Account, Loop check
│       ├── EmployeeRepository.java     --> Spring Data JPA queries
│       └── EmployeeSpecification.java  --> Dynamic JPA Search Filters
│
└── 📁 src/main/resources/
    ├── application.yml                 --> Port 8082, JWT secret key (24hr expiry)
    ├── application-dev.yml             --> PostgreSQL 5434 DB Connection
    └── db/migration/                   --> Flyway V1 (18 Tables) & V2 (Seed Admin Data)</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 3: Entity Relationship -->
    <div class="card">
        <h2>3. Database Tables Relationship (ER Diagram)</h2>
